 "notes": [
  {
   "title": "Nak pergi mana?",
   "body": "The driver's first question. The polite version adds a title: <i>Tuan nak pergi mana?</i> You can answer with just the place: <i>KLCC</i>."
  },
  {
   "title": "pukul and jam",
   "body": "For clock time, both work: <b>pukul lapan</b> or <b>jam lapan</b> = eight o'clock. <i>Pukul berapa?</i> asks the time."
  },
  {
   "title": "… tak?",
   "body": "<b>Jauh tak?</b> — far or not? Add <b>tak</b> to any adjective for a quick yes/no question: <i>sempat tak?</i>, <i>jem tak?</i>"
  }
 ],
